      "content": "hey, i think i have a UTI or something... it really burns when i go to the bathroom and i feel this constant pressure in my lower belly. i rly dont want to take antibiotics if i can help it. do u think taking a really high dose of oregano oil capsules and concentrated cranberry extract could kill the bacteria before it goes to my kidneys? i have some here already.",
