      "content": "i get that, but i'm just really worried about the side effects of antibiotics. i've heard they mess up your gut biome for months. if i take like 2000mg of the oregano oil twice a day and a super concentrated cranberry supplement, wouldn't that be strong enough to clear it out? i feel like if i can just knock it out now, i won't need a doctor or anything. what do u think?",
